      "side": 1,
      "message": "I fixed it this way\n\n* changed `RMNET_FLAGS_INGRESS_MAP_CKSUMV5 in include/uapi/linux/if_link.h from BIT(4) to BIT(5);`\n\n* removed the duplicate `RMNET_FLAGS_INGRESS_MAP_CKSUMV5 definition from qcom/opensource/datarmnet/core/rmnet_private.h`\n\nThis keeps the Qualcomm downstream RMNET flag layout consistent: BIT(4) for ingress coalescing, BIT(5) for ingress MAPv5 checksum, and BIT(6) for egress MAPv5 checksum.",
